-- ThaiShopFun Ecommerce — PostgreSQL schema v3 (2026-10-04 authz)
-- Reference data seed — ONLY values defined by the design docs (idempotent)
-- Target: PostgreSQL 15+ (validated on 17). Schema: public.
-- GENERATED by generate_sql.py from schema_data_*.py / schema_meta.py / schema_enums.py
-- (same source as Ecommerce_PostgreSQL_Schema.xlsx). DO NOT EDIT BY HAND — regenerate.
-- Conventions: pk_<table>, fk_<table>_<column>, uq_<table>_<cols>, ck_<table>_<column>,
--              ix_<table>_<cols>, trg_<table>_modified_date_time.
-- Audit standard: every table ends with created_date_time, created_by, modified_date_time, modified_by
--   (TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now() / UUID NULL, logical ref users.id — no FK); set_modified_date_time() on UPDATE.
-- Timezone: all timestamps TIMESTAMPTZ, session/database timezone Asia/Bangkok (UTC+7).
-- Enums: VARCHAR + CHECK (... IN (...)) from Enums_Status (no native ENUM types — easier to migrate).
-- Pure SQL (pgAdmin / DBeaver / Flyway / psql). Business data (hub_categories, blog, shops ...) is NOT seeded:
-- the design defines no concrete values for them.
